# Asset packs are dropped in here whole — bundles carry tens of thousands of
# files a browser game can never use (2D sprites, audio, UI, previews, Blender
# sources, FBX). Ignore everything, then re-include ONLY 3D model formats, so
# copying a full bundle in stages just the models instead of 100k+ files.
#
# Committed models are converted to GLB by tools/obj-to-glb.mjs and moved out
# of packs/; nothing here is served to players directly.

# ignore everything...
*

# ...but descend into directories so nested models are still found
!*/

# ...and keep the model formats we can load or convert
!*.glb
!*.gltf
!*.bin
!*.obj
!*.mtl

!README.md
!.gitignore
